<deviceset name="750315526" urn="urn:adsk.eagle:component:46931497/3" prefix="T">
<description>WE-OLTI Offline Flyback Transformers

Characteristics
Nominal input voltage: 85–265 VAC (120–375 VDC)
Small size
Low leakage inductance
Multiple-output options
Operating temperature: −40 °C to +125 °C
Isolation Voltage: 2 kVAC to 5 kVAC
Options for fixed frequency or quasi-resonant mode operation
Most products meet reinforced insulation

Applications
Industrial controls
USB chargers
Utility metering devices
Process controls
Factory automation
Security systems
Garage door opener auxiliary supplies
Home appliances
Especially designed for several ICs from Texas Instruments

Details see: www.we-online.com/en/components/products/WE-OLTI

Created by Ella 2025-02-06
2025 (C) Würth Elektronik</description>
